---
title: "supabaseInit (stem-bot-v2: src/utils/supabase.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_read_env: supabaseUrl = SUPABASE_URL or NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL
    q_read_env --> q_read_key: supabaseKey = SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY or NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
    q_read_key --> q_check: check both defined
    q_check --> q_throw: !supabaseUrl or !supabaseKey
    q_check --> q_create: both defined
    q_throw --> [*]: throw Error("Supabase URL or Key is missing")
    q_create --> [*]: supabase = createClient(url, key, schema = "member")

    note right of q_read_key
        INV-001: Falls back from service role key to anon key
        INV-002: Service role key has full database access (bypasses RLS)
        INV-003: Schema hardcoded to "member"
        INV-004: NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefixed env vars may be exposed in client bundles
    end note
